  - m_Id: 6606903277772800
    m_Localized: '...

      Zzz...

      Just a minute...

      Need some sleep...

      Too
      tired...

      My head hurts...

      Going to bed...

      Just for a while...

      I
      need a break...

      Can''t keep my eyes open...

      A little rest...

      Maybe
      tomorrow...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6607070307540992
    m_Localized: '...

      Deep breaths...

      Fresh air...

      Just a moment...

      A
      little better...

      It''s stuffy in here...

      Need some air...

      Take
      it easy...

      Clear my head...

      Slow down...

      That helps...

      Feeling
      better...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6607126242779136
    m_Localized: '...

      Taking pills...

      One more pill...

      Just
      a minute...

      This should help...

      Give it a moment...

      Need
      something...

      It''ll pass...

      Just rest...

      Maybe that''ll
      help...

      Wait a little...

      Feeling better...'
